E027_array_mixed_types.cmm:3:17: semantic error: array literal elements must all have the same primitive type
  |
3 |     let a = [1, "two"];
  |                 ^
what went wrong:
  Every item in an array literal '[...]' must have the same primitive type.
how to fix:
  Make sure all elements have matching types, for example all int or all
  string.
      [1, 2, 3]
